// tool.worker, three-quarter: the worker's hammer, drawn over every other
// layer while act_worker plays. Ready at the chest with its head toward screen
// right, raised above and behind the near shoulder, struck down in front at
// belt height. The handle stays open where the near fist closes round it.
canvas 64 64
anchor 32 64
frame act_worker 0
